note FixRound2Ng answer to bay 1's review of 36edfca2: stat on an empty path traps 3 before any kernel call
note (OMEGESE s10), with or without ngrun --scratch; the confinement refusal (119) comes after it.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 1 0
b = new uchar 128 0
k = stat a 0 0 b 0 128
ret int and k 255
end
